    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">The academic core</p>
      <h2>Subject teachers, real practical work</h2>
      <p>Each core subject has its own teacher with a degree in the field. <strong>English</strong> moves into literature, argument and writing for an audience. <strong>Maths</strong> builds toward IGCSE-level reasoning. <strong>Science</strong> covers biology, chemistry and physics with practical work every week.</p>
      <p>On top of the core, Year 7 studies <strong>History</strong> and <strong>Executive Function</strong>, which is the honest name for learning how to plan, organise and finish things.</p>
    </div>
    {% photo "secondary-marble-run-wall", "photo--lg photo--tilt-r" %}
  </div>
</section>

