    </div>
    <div class="cards cards--3" style="margin-top:32px">
      <div class="card"><h3>Art of Science</h3><p>Three afternoons a week. Experiments and builds that need the science from the morning to work.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Maker Space</h3><p>Tools, materials and a problem. Students design, build, test and present.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Movement</h3><p>Sport and fitness twice a week. By this age most students have found their thing, and we make room for it.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Wellbeing</h3><p>A weekly class on the things that make the rest of the week go better.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Review</h3><p>Time each week to consolidate, catch up and ask the question you did not ask in class.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Year 9 Checkpoint</h3><p>Optional Cambridge diagnostic in English, Maths and Science at the end of Year 9, and good preparation for exam pathways in Upper Years.</p></div>
